></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"Rsvp\" href=\"/en-US/front/client/rsvp\"><i class=\"ip-icon-phone-call\"></i>\nRsvp\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"Digital invitation\" href=\"/en-US/front/client/digital_invitation\"><i class=\"ip-icon-wedding-invitation\"></i>\nDigital invitation\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"Notify your guests\" href=\"/en-US/front/client/notify\"><i class=\"fal fa-comment\"></i>\nNotify your guests\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"Minisite\" href=\"/en-US/front/client/minisite\"><i class=\"fal fa-browser\"></i>\nMinisite\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"Reception\" href=\"/en-US/front/client/reception\"><i class=\"fal fa-tablet-alt\"></i>\nReception\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"FAQ\" href=\"/en-US/front/client/help\"><i class=\"fal fa-question\"></i>\nFAQ\n</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"header text-muted\">Vendors</li>\n<li><ul class=\"two-col\">\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"Your business toolbox\" href=\"/en-US/front/vendor/home\"><i class=\"fal fa-toolbox\"></i>\nYour business toolbox\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"Marketing\" href=\"/en-US/front/vendor/marketing\"><i class=\"fal fa-megaphone\"></i>\nMarketing\n</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"dropdown open\">\n<ul class=\"dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-lg\">\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"Venues\" href=\"/he-IL/directory/search/categories/1-מתחם-אירועים\"><i class=\"ip-icon-venue\"></i>\nVenues\n</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"dropdown open\">\n<h4>\nVendors\n</h4>\n<ul class=\"dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-lg\"><li><ul class=\"two-col\">\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"קייטרינג\" href=\"/he-IL/directory/search/categories/8-קייטרינג\"><i class=\"ip-icon-cook-hat\"></i>\nקייטרינג\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"שירותי בר\" href=\"/he-IL/directory/search/categories/25-שירותי-בר\"><i class=\"ip-icon-cocktail\"></i>\nשירותי בר\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"עיצוב\" href=\"/he-IL/directory/search/categories/6-עיצוב\"><i class=\"ip-icon-curtains\"></i>\nעיצוב\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"מוזיקה\" href=\"/he-IL/directory/search/categories/11-מוזיקה\"><i class=\"ip-icon-music\"></i>\nמוזיקה\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"צילום\" href=\"/he-IL/directory/search/categories/9-צילום\"><i class=\"ip-icon-camera\"></i>\nצילום\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"שמלות כלה וערב\" href=\"/he-IL/directory/search/categories/2-שמלות-כלה-וערב\"><i class=\"ip-icon-tailored-dress\"></i>\nשמלות כלה וערב\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"איפור ועיצוב שיער\" href=\"/he-IL/directory/search/categories/5-איפור-ועיצוב-שיער\"><i class=\"ip-icon-cosmetics\"></i>\nאיפור ועיצוב שיער\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"צילום מגנטים\" href=\"/he-IL/directory/search/categories/10-צילום-מגנטים\"><i class=\"ip-icon-pictures\"></i>\nצילום מגנטים\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"הזמנות ומיתוג\" href=\"/he-IL/directory/search/categories/23-הזמנות-ומיתוג-לאירוע\"><i class=\"ip-icon-wedding-invitation\"></i>\nהזמנות ומיתוג\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"הסעות לאורחים\" href=\"/he-IL/directory/search/categories/19-הסעות-לאורחים\"><i class=\"ip-icon-bus\"></i>\nהסעות לאורחים\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"תכשיטים ואקססוריז\" href=\"/he-IL/directory/search/categories/32-תכשיטים-ואקססוריז\"><i class=\"ip-icon-wedding-rings\"></i>\nתכשיטים ואקססוריז\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"הפקת אירוע\" href=\"/he-IL/directory/search/categories/37-הפקת-אירוע\"><i class=\"ip-icon-planner\"></i>\nהפקת אירוע\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a title=\"אטרקציות\" href=\"/he-IL/directory/search/categories/18-אטרקציות\"><i class=\"ip-icon-party\"></i>\nאטרקציות\n</a></li>\n<li class=\"empty\" style=\"visibility: hidden\">\n<a tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" href=\"#\"><i class=\"ip-icon-table-with-chairs\"></i>\n&nbsp;\n</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"dropdown open\">\n<ul class=\"dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-lg\">\n<li class=\"header text-muted\">We're here for any question</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"/en-US/front/contact\"><i class=\"fas fa-envelope\"></i>\nContact us\n</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<main role=\"main\">\n<section class=\"section section-lg section-hero text-center\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<h1>\n<i class=\"ip-icon-table-with-chairs display-block\"></i>\nFloor plan\n</h1>\n<h2 class=\"section-hero-subtitle\">Plan, move and seat your guests using a birds eye view of your floor plan</h2>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section section-lg cooperate\">\n<div class=\"container-fluid\" style=\"max-width: 1700px\">\n<div class=\"r-space-b-8 text-center\">\n<h2>Build a perfect event together!</h2>\n<div class=\"text-muted\">Move the divider from side to side</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-4 col-md-offset-2 text-center old\">\n<h3>They used to do it like this...</h3>\n<div class=\"text-muted\">The most advanced technology when it came to event planning was pen and paper. Communication between you and your vendors was clumsy and far from efficient. Time to forget about the fax machine and move forward to a world where technology works for you and not the other way around.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-12\">\n<div class=\"old-new\">\n<img class=\"img-responsive new_sketch\" alt=\"סקיצה חדשה\" src=\"/assets/front_client_sketches__sketch_new.jpg\">\n<div class=\"old\"></div>\n<div class=\"divider\">\n<div class=\"slider\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 text-center new\">\n<h3>Ans this is how it's done today!</h3>\n<div class=\"text-muted\">With our simple interface we've made event planning simple to all types of users. Communication between you and your vendors is now perfectly efficient. Become a pro and let technology work hard so you don't have to.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section section-lg section-gray get-started text-center-xs\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"r-space-b-8\">\n<h2>Find the perfect spot for every guest</h2>\n<div class=\"text-muted\">With a floor plan created specifically for your event it's easy to decide who is seated next to who, and more importantly where will the table be located? Obviously we don't grandma seating next to the dancefloor the whole night.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"r-space-b-3\"><a class=\"btn btn-lg btn-info\" href=\"/en-US/client/sign_in\">Start the seating arrangement</a></div>\nAlready registered? <a href=\"/en-US/client/sign_in\">Log in</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"space-t-xs-8 visible-xs\"><img class=\"img-responsive\" alt=\"סקיצה של מתחם אירועים\" src=\"/assets/front_client_sketches__venue_mobile.jpg\"></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section section-lg features text-center-xs\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"r-space-b-8\">\n<h2>\nA floor plan created just for you!\n</h2>\nAll you need to do is drag and drop guest names into the desired table\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"feature r-space-b-6\">\n<h3>Where is the dance floor?</h3>\nWith a detailed overview of the event's floor plan, you can make sure your friends are seated next to the dance floor and grandma doesn't have to suffer from the noise the speakers make!\n</li>\n<li class=\"feature r-space-b-6\">\n<h3>Who needs a special dish?</h3>\nUse the seating arrangements feature to mark for yourself and the venue where guests with specific requirements are located.\n</li>\n<li class=\"feature r-space-b-6\">\n<h3>Full sync with the RSVP service</h3>\nEvery update received through the RSVP service effects the seating arrangements. For example, a guest you seated changed from 1 to 2 guests? The amount seated in the table will change accordingly!\n</li>\n<li class=\"feature r-space-b-6\">\n<h3>No guest is left unseated</h3>\nAt any moment you can view the guests you haven't seated yet in order to follow your progress. In addition, you can always print a copy for the family representative, with a sketch and an updated guest list!\n</li>\n<li class=\"feature r-space-b-6\">\n<h3>Need another table? No more faxes or Emails!</h3>\nThe event manager, creating your specific floor plan, can always add or move a table with regards to changes made during the seating and RSVP process. All you have to do is just refresh the page and keep going!\n</li>\n<li class=\"feature r-space-b-6\">\n<h3>How will my guests know where they are seated?</h3>\nIf the venue provides seating services, your guest list and seating arrangements is waiting at the reception desk on a designated iPad! If not? You can always work with a printed list and seating cards.\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"text-center\">\n<div class=\"container space-xs-12 space-sm-21\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-xs-24 col-sm-6 space-b-xs-5\">\n<h2 class=\"footer-column-title\">iPlan</h2>\n<div class=\"space-t-xs-1\"><a href=\"/en-US/front/contact\">Contact us</a></div>\n<div class=\"space-t-xs-1\"><a href=\"/en-US/front/about\">About</a></div>\n<div class=\"space-t-xs-1\"><a href=\"/en-US/front/jobs\">Career</a></div>\n<div class=\"space-t-xs-1\"><a href=\"https://iplan.co.il/en-US/client/legal_info/privacy_statement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Privacy policy</a></div>\n<div class=\"space-t-xs-1\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"/en-US/front/accessibility_statement\">Accessibility statement</a></div>\n<div class=\"space-t-xs-1\"><a style=\"text-decoration: none\" class=\"flag\" onclick=\"\" title=\"Hebrew\" aria-label=\"Hebrew\" href=\"/he-IL/front/client/sketches\"><img class=\"triangle\" alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/blank.gif\">\n<img class=\"flag\" alt=\"Hebrew\" src=\"/assets/flags__il.png\">\n</a><a style=\"text-decoration: none\" class=\"flag selected\" onclick=\"\" title=\"English\" aria-label=\"English\" href=\"/en-US/front/client/sketches\"><img class=\"triangle\" alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/blank.gif\">\n<img class=\"flag\" al